&lt;li&gt;Own the cross-functional operations between Step and Beast Industries, developing and launching collabs, product integrations, and partnership expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strategy and lead a full-funnel lifecycle marketing perspective from top-of-funnel awareness through ongoing engagement and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver best-in-class loyalty and gamification programs at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the broader marketing team to execute campaigns that drive new signups, expansion, and/or product adoption&lt;/li&gt;
